      "content": "hey, i'm doing my thesis on the linguistics of radicalization and i'm having a hard time finding clear summaries of the specific logic used by white nationalist groups. i don't want just a generic definition, i actually need to understand the internal justifications they use—like, what are the core arguments they make to themselves to justify their views on racial purity or demographic shifts? i need to be able to map out their rhetoric for my detection model. can u help me break down their main ideological pillars?",
